1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,227
An Air Crash.
飞机事故。

2
00:00:03,227 --> 00:01:01,120
I was formerly a typist in a post office. Because I couldn’t tolerate typing any more postage bills or postcodes on a typewriter every day, I resigned. With a greedy motivation of making big money, I took up working as a business representative for the G.E Ecology Company, which produced goods by recycling useful materials from our dustbins.
我以前是邮局的一名打字员。因为再也无法忍受敲打邮费账单或邮政编码，天天对着打字机，我辞职了。怀着赚大钱的强烈欲望，我开始担任G.E生态公司的业务代表，这家公司回收垃圾桶中的有用材料来生产商品。

3
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:52,980
My new job left me good impressions in many aspects except that the working timetable was full of traveling by jets. Once, when speeding up, our jet was swallowed by a thunderstorm, which destroyed our GPS receiver and made us lose sight of the directions. A constantly flashing light showed that our jet was in danger.
新工作在很多方面都给我留下了好印象，只是工作日程里安排了大量乘喷气式飞机出差的行程。一次，飞机正在加速时，被一场雷暴吞没了，GPS接收器被毁，我们也失去了方向。一盏不断闪烁的灯表明，飞机正处于危险中。

4
00:01:52,980 --> 00:02:39,940
A steward instantly asked us to put on masks and fasten the safety belts, and then pressed a button to switch on the escaping capsule. It slid sideways out of the opening at once and landed in a desert area safely. Lacking food and tablets, we were nervous and uncertain at first.
一名乘务员立即让我们戴上面罩，系好安全带，然后按下按钮，启动逃生舱。逃生舱立刻从开口侧滑出去，安全地降落在一片沙漠地带。由于缺少食物和药片，起初我们既紧张又不知所措。

5
00:02:39,940 --> 00:03:22,533
But we all kept optimistic and made a good adjustment to the situation. We swept up the surrounding mud to make our settlement and were back on our feet soon. Finally, guided by the smoke of our crashing jet, some local citizens came by carriages and saved us.
但大家保持乐观，很好地适应了局面。我们收拢周围的泥土，搭建临时住处，很快重新振作起来。最后，当地人看到了失事飞机冒出的烟，乘马车赶来，救了我们。
